---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Impressum"
  description="Legal notice, operator details, and contact information for DNAthletic."
>
  <section class="article">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        Back to homepage
      </a>

      <header class="article-header">
        <h1>Impressum</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="impressum-specs">
        <div class="spec-block">
          <span class="spec-label">Operator &amp; Responsible for Content</span>
          <div class="spec-val">
            <strong>Nikolas Drimmel</strong><br />
            Mozartring 3<br />
            84405 Dorfen<br />
            Germany<br />
            <span class="spec-note">§ 5 DDG &middot; § 18 Abs. 2 MStV</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spec-block">
          <span class="spec-label">Contact</span>
          <div class="spec-val">
            Email: <a href="mailto:nikolas@drimmel.de">nikolas@drimmel.de</a><br />
            Web: <a href="https://dnathletic.com">dnathletic.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="impressum-disclaimer">
        <strong>Liability for content:</strong> As a service provider, I am responsible for my own content on these pages under general law, but I am not obliged to monitor transmitted or stored third-party information. Content is compiled with care; however, no liability is assumed for its accuracy, completeness, or timeliness.
      </p>
      <p class="impressum-disclaimer">
        <strong>Liability for links:</strong> This site may contain links to external websites over whose content I have no control. Responsibility for that content lies solely with the respective operators, who were not aware of any unlawful content at the time of linking.
      </p>
      <p class="impressum-disclaimer">
        <strong>Consumer dispute resolution:</strong> I am neither willing nor obliged to participate in dispute-resolution proceedings before a consumer arbitration board (§ 36 VSBG). The EU Online Dispute Resolution platform was discontinued in 2025.
      </p>
      <p class="impressum-disclaimer">
        <strong>Training disclaimer:</strong> The contents of this website are provided for editorial and informational purposes only and do not constitute medical or individual training advice. While care is taken to ensure scientific rigor, training decisions should always be adapted to individual capacities.
      </p>

      <p class="impressum-disclaimer">
        See also the <a href="/datenschutz">privacy policy</a> for details on how data is handled.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
